{"question_id": "SMK-04", "request_id": "094df81605ae4c9283b9905c9b2789a5", "trace_id": "6dbf08b2762b4956a40f33a5a5e40815", "http_status": 200, "question": "泵不输送液体时可能的原因是什么？", "answer": "泵不输送液体时可能的原因包括：\n\n- 泵没有灌注。\n- 旋转方向不正确。\n- 叶轮卡塞。\n- 入口管路堵塞。\n\n以上信息来源于《安装、操作及维护手册》（文件名：2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，页码：23）。", "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 37, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-07d5c9ba07e1-000-07d5c9ba07e1"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 35, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}], "refusal": false, "refusal_reason": null, "parser_pipeline": "pymupdf_standard_adapter", "query_mode": "mix", "top_k": 12, "chunk_top_k": 20, "parent_expansion": "none", "rerank": false, "answer_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "requested_model": "qwen-plus-2025-07-28", "actual_model": ["qwen-plus-2025-07-28"], "fallback": false, "retrieved_chunk_ids": ["cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-edddb0cca40c-000-edddb0cca40c", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-408b57771ee4-000-408b57771ee4", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-95388e1fa0ac-000-95388e1fa0ac", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-0f44c075b8e8-000-0f44c075b8e8", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-6af6a3e6aaa8-000-6af6a3e6aaa8", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d913d9c15acb-000-d913d9c15acb", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-07d5c9ba07e1-000-07d5c9ba07e1", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-ce631c176fb5-000-ce631c176fb5", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-30658010fdb2-000-30658010fdb2", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-a6217f0db196-000-a6217f0db196", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-150d65b3f4c3-000-150d65b3f4c3", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-0cdb66a95926-000-0cdb66a95926", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-db01d9f3b0b4-000-db01d9f3b0b4", "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2fc3d4695355-000-2fc3d4695355", "cchun